## [[surround|Surrounded]] by; [[among]]; [[amidst]].
##: {{ux|en|We are '''in''' the enemy camp.}}
##: {{ux|en|Her plane is '''in''' the air.}}
##: {{ux|en|Waiter! There's a fly '''in''' my soup!}}
